---
---

<section id="projects" class="reveal space-y-6 border-t border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800/80 pt-16">
  <div class="space-y-1">
    <h2 class="text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400">GitHub Repositories</h2>
    <h3 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">Proyek & Karya Pilihan di GitHub</h3>
    <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
      Repositori yang dikembangkan secara langsung di profil <a href="https://github.com/adincomara" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 underline font-mono">@adincomara</a>.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-5">
    
    <!-- Repo 1: CatatUang -->
    <div class="tech-card reveal delay-100 p-6 sm:p-7 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800/80 shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg hover:border-indigo-300 dark:hover:border-indigo-800/60 space-y-3">
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
          <span class="text-2xl">💰</span>
          <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
            CatatUang — Smart Financial Tracking PWA & Vision AI
          </h4>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-[10px] font-mono font-semibold bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-950/40 text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-300 border border-emerald-200 dark:border-emerald-800/40 w-fit">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 animate-pulse"></span>
            Live Production
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
        Aplikasi pencatatan keuangan mobile-first (PWA & WebView) yang mengintegrasikan model <strong>Vision AI OCR</strong> untuk mengekstrak nominal, toko, dan barang dari foto nota secara otomatis. Mendukung manajemen multi-dompet, sistem cutoff bulanan, otentikasi Google OAuth, serta ekspor spreadsheet (.xlsx).
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-3 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800/60 text-xs">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800">JavaScript</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800">Vision AI</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800">Tailwind</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800">PWA</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
          <a href="https://money.adincomara.my.id" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-semibold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 hover:underline">
            <span>money.adincomara.my.id</span>
            <span>↗</span>
          </a>
          <a href="https://github.com/adincomara/catatuang" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-semibold text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 hover:underline font-mono">
            <span>Source Code</span>
            <span>→</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Repo 2: SIMPUS & PTM Healthcare Systems -->
    <div class="tech-card reveal delay-200 p-6 sm:p-7 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800/80 shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg hover:border-indigo-300 dark:hover:border-indigo-800/60 space-y-3">
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
          <span class="text-2xl">🏥</span>
          <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
            SIMPUS & PTM — Healthcare Management Information System
          </h4>
        </div>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-[10px] font-mono font-semibold bg-indigo-50 dark:bg-indigo-950/40 text-indigo-700 dark:text-indigo-300 border border-indigo-200 dark:border-indigo-800/40 w-fit">
          Health Tech & Laravel
        </span>
      </div>

      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
        Sistem Informasi Manajemen Puskesmas (SIMPUS) dan sistem monitoring skrining Penyakit Tidak Menular (PTM) untuk pencatatan rekam medis, antrean pasien, manajemen obat/farmasi, serta pelaporan layanan kesehatan publik berbasis web dengan arsitektur PHP/Laravel dan Blade template.
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-3 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800/60 text-xs">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800">PHP</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800">Laravel / Blade</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800">MySQL</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800">Inspinia</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
          <a href="https://github.com/adincomara/puskesmas" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-semibold text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 hover:underline font-mono">
            <span>adincomara/puskesmas</span>
            <span>↗</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Repo 3: Dijkstra Maps -->
    <div class="tech-card reveal delay-300 p-6 sm:p-7 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800/80 shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg hover:border-indigo-300 dark:hover:border-indigo-800/60 space-y-3">
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
          <span class="text-2xl">🗺️</span>
          <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
            DijkstraMaps — Shortest Path Routing & Geospatial Mapping
          </h4>
        </div>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-[10px] font-mono font-semibold bg-sky-50 dark:bg-sky-950/40 text-sky-700 dark:text-sky-300 border border-sky-200 dark:border-sky-800/40 w-fit">
          Graph Algorithm
        </span>
      </div>

      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
        Aplikasi pemetaan interaktif yang mengimplementasikan <strong>Algoritma Graf Dijkstra</strong> untuk menentukan jalur dan rute navigasi terpendek antar titik lokasi/node koordinat peta geografis secara dinamis dan efisien.
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-3 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800/60 text-xs">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800">Dijkstra Algorithm</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800">JavaScript</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800">PHP</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800">Maps API</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
          <a href="https://github.com/adincomara/djikstramaps" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-semibold text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 hover:underline font-mono">
            <span>adincomara/djikstramaps</span>
            <span>↗</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Repo 4: Open Source & Inventory Systems -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5">
      <!-- Manajemen Barang & Toko -->
      <div class="tech-card reveal delay-300 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800/80 shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg hover:border-indigo-300 dark:hover:border-indigo-800/60 space-y-3">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-xl">📦</span>
          <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Inventory & E-Commerce Systems</h4>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          Koleksi aplikasi web manajemen inventaris gudang/stok barang dan katalog toko online berbasis CRUD relasional database yang rapi dan terstruktur.
        </p>
        <div class="pt-2 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800/60 text-xs">
          <span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400">PHP • MySQL</span>
          <a href="https://github.com/adincomara/manajemenbarang" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="font-mono text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 hover:underline">adincomara/manajemenbarang ↗</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- TeaLinuxOS Contribution -->
      <div class="tech-card reveal delay-400 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800/80 shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg hover:border-indigo-300 dark:hover:border-indigo-800/60 space-y-3">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-xl">🐧</span>
          <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">TeaLinuxOS Web Contribution</h4>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          Kontribusi open-source pada repositori web portal resmi distro TeaLinuxOS (distro Linux karya anak bangsa yang dikhususkan untuk developer).
        </p>
        <div class="pt-2 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800/60 text-xs">
          <span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400">Hexo • Open Source</span>
          <a href="https://github.com/adincomara/tealinuxos.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="font-mono text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 hover:underline">adincomara/tealinuxos.org ↗</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
